+INVARIANT SuccessfulEmptyNeverDispatches
+INVARIANT NonRetryableFailureNeverDispatches
+INVARIANT FallbackRequiresCanonicalRecoveryEvidence
+PROPERTY EventuallyPriorityRecoveryDispatch
+CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
